      "content": "It takes immense strength to articulate that deep sense of identity loss, and I hear how profound this feels for you. While I cannot replace a therapist, connecting with a professional who understands identity crises can offer a perspective on how to navigate this massive shift. If the thought of immediate crisis lines feels unhelpful right now, perhaps reaching out to a counselor specializing in grief or professional transitions could provide a safer space to map out what \"rebuilding\" might mean for you. Your value as a person is not defined by what you have or what you have lost.",
